Package: rw
Title: Robins-Wang Variance Estimation for Multiply Imputed Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lucy", "D'Agostino McGowan", , "lucydagostino@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Suyang", "Yu", role = "aut"),
    person("Mark", "Giganti", role = "ctb"),
    person("Brian", "Williamson", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Computes the Robins-Wang variance estimator for analyses performed
  on datasets that have been multiply imputed using the mice package. The core
  package implements RW-MICE for parametric chained-equation imputation using
  norm and logreg models from mice, and RW-PMM for predictive mean matching.
